      "description": "<p>When a seaweed leshy dies, a burst of primal energy explodes from its body, restoring 3d8 Healing Damage Hit Points to each plant creature in a 30ft Emanation. This area fills with seaweed, becoming difficult terrain. If the terrain is not a viable environment for the seaweed, they wither after 24 hours.</p>",
